*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Minimal hand-written PPD for testing the cups driver with a PCL raster filter.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LASERPCL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(Generic PCL Laser)"
*ModelName: "Generic PCL Laser"
*ShortNickName: "Generic PCL Laser"
*NickName: "Generic PCL Laser, test PPD"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "10"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsBackSide: "Normal"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertohp"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12 12 408 583"
*ImageableArea Legal/Legal: "12 12 600 996"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension Legal/Legal: "612 1008"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Automatic: "<</MediaPosition 0>>setpagedevice"
*InputSlot Manual/Manual Feed: "<</MediaPosition 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*% End of laser-pcl.ppd
